  "details": "On the live version of VRChat, if an object with object sync falls below the respawn height, said object is either respawned or destroyed. However, on the beta version the object will continue to fall out of the world. This issue only appears to affect VRCSDK3 worlds.\nI have prepared two worlds to demonstrate this. In both worlds there is a sphere that can be pickup and toss out of the world. In the live version the sphere is either respawned or destroyed before it lands on the blue platform. In the beta version the sphere will instead land on the blue platform and proceed to roll off of it.\nObject Respawn Test\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_087e5a8a-f6a5-40e0-a5cf-61d038e2bbc6\nObject Destruction Test\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_acf8e979-430e-4017-97ae-95e7da8abb37",
